#: freeports_dev.cli:3 of
msgid ""
"Every subcommand takes its settings from a "
":class:`~freeports_dev.config.DevConfig` rather than reading the "
"environment itself, so that one setting resolves the same way whichever "
"subcommand asked for it. The options shared with the engine — the "
"repository, the input database, the configuration file, the target lists "
"— are declared once, on the parent parsers below, and carry the same "
"names and short letters `freeports` uses."
msgstr ""

